<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Ibraawe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibraawe Asuntsis Xaafinttide Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ibraawe</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ibr.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ibraawe Asuntsis</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafinttide Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Hyay kiitize xaafinttidanna, damma madha yellin, fa ammantto ashshodes ukkide ammanze asuntsis. Hyay maxaafize xaafize, Yesuus Kiristtoosa wurssutsin turii Xoozze qonccitsi maaqqidanno Ibraawe asuntsis beezane. Yinna ammanze asuntsi fa ammantte minggode fana unttana mintsitsane. E yinne hyaydzdzii aafe qofa waanna mahi beezane.</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Yesuusa fa ekkide madhite Ades turo kiitinttide medhina Xoozze Na7a. E Xoozze Na7a maaqqide gisho Gal77a Caaqo wode yeze nabuntsappa, kiitanchchuntsappan Museppa kattara.</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Yesuusa Gal77a Caaqo kahinuntsappa gaama aadhize medhina kahine maaqqidanno Xoozii fa ommite markkidhida.</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Yesuusa baggara ammanze asi nagarappa, zhashimoppan hyayqoppa attane. Yesuusa kahinunts hyalaqa maaqqidanni gaar, zaga Ibraawunts ammano wogaran hyaars zharshora dasho fana benttize atotitsito hyatte turo mahida.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xaafize Isra7eele asuntsis taarikera gaama erinttide asunts ammano malla mahi ekkii (Zofa 11) hyay maxaafiza nabbabize asuntsana fa ammantte minggode fana qofizane. Yinnii fana, zofane 12 nabbabizuntsi fa aafto Yesuusalla afa gaddii, fa ammantte minggode fanan akko madhan waayen yellikon, un genccode gaar zorane. Wurssutsite zoren tiirize qaalara fa kiitto kusttane.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Gele qofa: Xoozii Kiristtoosara qonccidanno <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa kiitanchchuntsappa kattara <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1:4—2:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa Museppan Iyyaasuppa kattara <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3:1—4:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa kahinetitsita kattara <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14—7:28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa caaqita kattara <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 8:1-9:22">8:1—9:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa zharshita kattara <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 9:23-10:39">9:23—10:39</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammanora yeze <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 11:1-12:29">11:1—12:29</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoozza ufaysse <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:1-19">13:1-19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Anjjon xaatsi qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:20-25">13:20-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Na7ay kiitanchchuntsappa kattara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Zaga Xoozii, nu aduntsis nabunts baggara dumma dumma ogera gaama wode ohida. <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>Yezin hyanna wurssutsi wodite ubbanno eza laatizide mahi alamito E baggara medhdhide fa Na7ay baggara nuus ohida. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Na7ay Xoozze bonchcho foo7izen kumutsi Xoozze Xoozzetitsito ekkii, fa wolqqa qaalara hyanna alamito katii aykkida. Asuntsana un nagarappa geeshidannippa suuba Ubbappa kattara Xoozze mizaqi zalara salo bettida.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Ees ingginttide suntsita kiitanchchuntsi suntsappa kattara maaqqidanni fana E unttappa kattara. <verse eid="HEB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Yikke, Xoozii kiitanchchuntsappa oodego,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Neenii ta Na7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">ta hyayno nees ade maaqqida» gaydo?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Woy mahi oodego,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Taanii ees ade maaqqada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">ezin taas na7a maaqqada» gaydo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam. 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Zeena 17:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Mahi Xoozii fa anggis Na7aya hyanna alamite kiittitera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">«Xoozze kiitanchchuntsi ubba ees goyno»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:6">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Mahe 32:43</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Xoozii kiitanchchuntsi baz ohitera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">«Xoozii fa Kiitanchchuntsana ayyaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">fa aruntsana tama loxe mahine»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:7">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Maz. 104:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Yezin fa Na7ay baz ohitera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">«Xoozzayo, ne ka7itumtta medhinas yene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Ne ka7itumtto ne xillotitsara aho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:6-7">Maz. 45:6-7</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Neenii xillotitsi kadhida; iita ixxida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Xoozii, ne Laatstse, nena ne lagguntsappa aatsii doorida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ufays zayte<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ufays zayte: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">E ka7itize wode asuntsi ufayssara loytsi eza ka7itisizanno beezane. </char></note> nena tizhida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:9">yagayda. <verse eid="HEB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Xoozii mahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">«Laatstsayo, tiino neenii sa7a medhdhida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">saluntsi ne kushe oocha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Maz. 102:25-27</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Yentses ubba dhaboda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">yezin ne yessada.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Un ubba afula fana hyal7oda.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>Ne magaraja fana xaaxoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">mahi un afula fana cinggoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Yezin neenii ubba wode nena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">ne beritan hyal7oos»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:12">yagayda. <verse eid="HEB 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Yezin Xoozii kiitanchchuntsappa oodego,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">«Taanii ne morkkuntsana ne tohita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">yedhdhize bessi mahode wontsis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">hyanne taappa mizaqi zalara betto» gaydo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Kiitanchchuntsi ubba atotitsi denggodes yeze asuntsana maaddodes Xoozii kiittide ayyaanuntsana baane?<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Damma anjjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Yinnii gisho, nuunii si7ide turippa melle bessa ekinttaame gaar yinna si7idanno mintsii naagodes beezane. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Yikke, kiitanchchuntsi baggara ohinttide qaaltta turo maaqqiko, eza qohen kiitinttanxi ixxe firdda ki7izebaz maaqqiko, <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>yeezin, nuunii hyannii gaar damma atotitsi koyoos gayko, wayzi attode? Tiino Laatstsii fa ommite yinna atotitsito ohida; mahi eeppa si7iduntsi nuus geeshi markkidhida. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Mahi Xoozii mallaran, kille bazara, dumma dumma kille baz fa qoftti gaar inggide Geeshi Ayyaana imotitsara markkatitsito mintsida.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa asi maaqqida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Xoozii hyanna nuunii ohize tiinoppa ye7ode alamito, kiitanchchuntsis ahizikaaya. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Geeshi Maxaafite fettii bessa hyannigaara yagayda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">«Neenii asis qoppodes asi akko?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">Woy neenii eza naagodes as na7ay akko?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Maz. 8:4-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Ne E kiitanchchuntsappa xiqina eeratsida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">E ommite bonchchon nashsho barneexa gaddida.<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>Mahi ubbabazito E tohitippa oomora gaddida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">yagayda. Xoozii ubbabazito ees ahize wode ees aqikaayze bazi akkon baaya. Yezin hyatte ubba bazi ees aqodera nuunii hyaga bi7ikaaya. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Yezin nuunii kiitanchchuntsappa xiqina eeride Yesuusa be7ine. Xoozze aadho keehatitsiti baggara Yesuusa as ubbas hyayqqida. E waaye hyayqo hyayqqide gisho bonchchon nashsho barneexa E ommite gaddida. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Ubba bazi eesin E baggara medhinttide Xoozii, gaama na7untsana faara bonchchisades un atotitsitis omma, Yesuusa waayto folo mahodes ees beezane.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Yesuusan yentsi E geeshide asuntsi ubba fettii ade na7untsana. Yesuusa unttana, «Ta ishuntsana» ga7i xeegodes yeellidhoosanna yinnisi. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>Yesuusa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">«Taanii ne suntsito ta ishuntsis awaajjoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">worzha shiiqite nena galatoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:12">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Maz. 22:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Mahi E, «Taanii ta ammantto eella afa gaddoda» Mahin, «Xoozii taas inggide na7untsara ta hyanne yene» yagaane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Isa. 8:17-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Na7untsi ashon suutsi yezuntsana maaqqide gisho Yesuusan un fana asi maaqqida. E yinno oochchidanna, hyayqolla afa wolqqa yeze Xalahiza fa hyayqite dhabsodes. <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>Mahi fa yeze berite ubba hyayqo zhashmora aridhdhii yezuntsana arotitsappa kessodes.<verse eid="HEB 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Turo Yesuusa yi7idanna Abrahama kochchi maaddodes fattin kiitanchchuntsana maaddodes baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8-9">Isa. 41:8-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>As nagara atto ga7inttode fana Xoozze tiino maarize ammaninttide kahinunts hyalaqa maaqqida. Yinnii gisho, E ubbabazite fa ishuntsana aazodes beezane. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>E fa ommite fatanara waayinttide gisho fattaninttizuntsana maaddodes dandda7ane.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Museppa kattara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozii xeegide geeshi ishuntso, nu ammanora Laatstso ga7i xeegize hawaaren kahinunts hyalaqa Yesuusa bo7ote. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Muse Xoozze Keetstsa ubba ammaninttidanni fana Yesuusan fana dooride Xoozzes ammaninttidaya. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Keetstsi keexizay keetsitifa aadhii bonchchinttizanni fana Yesuusa Museppa aadhize bonchcho ekkodes beezane. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Feta feta keetsiza keexide asi yene, yezin ubbanno giigizide Xoozii. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Muse Xoozze Keetstsa ubbanne ammaninttide aro maaqqii, Xoozii tiinoppa gawudebazis markka maaqqida. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Yezin Kiristtoosa Xoozze Keetsite na7a fana ammaninttidaya. Nuunii ekkoda ga7i naagize ufaysito mintsii naagiko Xoozze keetstsi maaqqane.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze asis yeze shemppo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Yinnii gisho, Geeshi Ayyaana gaazanni fana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">«Hyayno yin Xoozii gaazanno si7ize wode<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>akko baayze sa7a fattanize qamma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">yin aduntsi gene hyanttidanni fana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">yin wozintto mintsippete.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Yin aduntsi tana fattanida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">oyttam bere ta oochito bi7ida.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Yinnii gisho, ta yentsi yeletuntsana kacci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">‹Un ubba wode fa wozintte balane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">ta ogito erikaaya› yagayda.<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Yinnii gisho, taanii zhilora caaqqii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‹Ta shemppo besito mulon geloos› yagayda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Maz. 95:7-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 3:11">yagaane.<verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Ta ishuntso, yinttappa ooden, de7o Xoozzeppa yinttana shaakkize iitan ammanoose wozina yezaame gaar naaginttote. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Yinttappa ooden nagara balitsin, fa wozintto mintsaame gaar «Hyayno» ga7intti xeeginttodera qammite qammite fete fetera zorinttote. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Nu tiino ammantto nuunii wurssutsi yellodes mintsii naagiko, Kiristtoosara wolla shaakkinttizuntsana. <verse eid="HEB 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">«Hyayno Xoozii gaazanno yin si7ize wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">ye wode un cubbora hyanidanni fana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">yin wozintto mintsippete»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 3:15">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Maz. 95:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Xoozii gaazebaz si7i cubbudhiduntsi oode? Muse Gibxxeppa kaalitsi kesside ubbuntsana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Faydo 14:1-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Xoozii oyttam bere oona kaccido? Nagara oochchiduntsanan un ahita akko baayze sa7a wodhdhii attide asuntsana baane? <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Mahi Xoozii, «Ta shemppo besito geloos» yaga7i caaqqidanna, ees kiitinttanxide asuntsana baane? <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Yikke, un yinna shemppo besito gelanxidanna ammanikaayze gisho maaqqidanno nu be7ine.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Yikke, Xoozii nuna fa shemppo besito geltsoda gayde qaaltta hyaga tiino yeze gisho yinttappa ooden yinna shemppo besito gelanxi attaame fana naaginttoda. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Unttis misiraachcho qaala sabbakinttidannifana, nuusin sabbakinttida. Yezin un si7ide qaaltto ammanii ekkikaayze gisho unttana maaddikaaya. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Maaqqikon, alame medhinttidannippa aykkii Xoozze oochita folinttida maaqqikon, Xoozii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">«Taanii ta zhilora caaqqi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">ta shemppo besito mulon geloos»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">gaydannigaara, nuunii ammaniduntsi E shemppo besito geloda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Maz. 95:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Laappuntso qammabaz fettii besite, «Xoozii laappuntso qammite fa oocha ubbannippa shemppida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Medho 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Mahin yinna besite, «Un ta shemppo besite mulon geloos» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Maz. 95:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Tiino misiraachcho qaala si7i kiitinttanxi shemppo besito gelikaaya. Yeykon, hyatte yinna shemppo besito gelode fettii fettii asuntsi yene. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozii, «Hyayno» ga7i xeegittera fettii qamma nuus qaxaro inggi ersida. Gaama wodeppa suuba Xoozii Dawute baggara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">«Xoozii gaazebaz hyayno yin si7ize wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">yin wozintto mintsippete»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:7">yaga7i ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Maz. 95:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Iyyaasu unttis shemppo inggidebaz maaqqizeko, Xoozii melle qammabaz suubappa ohoos yeshsha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Mahe 31:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Iya. 22:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Yikke, Xooz asis Sambbata shemppo hyaga naaginttii yene. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Xoozze shemppo besito gelize ooden, Xoozii fa oochchitippa shemppidannifana ezin fa oochchitippa shemppoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Medho 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Yinnii gisho, ooden yentsi asunts kiitinttanxi ixxidanno kaallii, gol7aame fana Xoozze shemppo besito gelodes minggoda.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Xoozze qaala de7on oochchizaya. Lam77i zalara leefinttide mashshappa aadhii oco. E shemppo, ayyaana, shazhan kolizen yellodes gelii caddane. Mahi as wozintte yeze aachinttide qofan amuto shaakkii firddane. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Xoozze tiino aachinttide akko medhetitsin baaya. E aafti tiino ubba bazi qonccen kallo yene. Nuunii mahe inggodes beeze E tiino.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Damma kahinunts hyalaqa Yesuusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Yikke, salo kezide damma kahinunts hyalaqize, Xoozze na7ay Yesuusa, nuus yeze gisho nu ammantto mintsii naagoda. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Nu kahinunts hyalaqize nu labbize wode nuus yiqsinttodes dandda7izaya. E nagara oochchikaaya, yezin nu fana ubba baza fattaninttida. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Yikke, maarotitsi ekkodesin maade koshshize wode aadho keehatitsi denggodes aadho keehatitsita yeze bessa Xoozze ka7itumo araatago zhashimo baytsi shiiqoda.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Fettii fettii kahinunts hyalaqa asunts giddappa doorintti, Xoozara yeltsize baza as gisho imon nagara zharsho zharshodes shuumunttane. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>E fa ommite labbitsi maaqqide gisho eroosuntsisin balinttiduntsis yiqsinttodes dandda7ane. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>E fa nagara gishon as ubba nagara gisho zharsho zharshodes beezanna yinnisi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Leewe 9:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Ooden hyanna bonchchito faas ekkodes dandda7oos, yezin Aarona kahinunts hyalaqa maaqqades xeeginttidanni fana Xoozara xeeginttodes beezane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Keze 28:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Yinnii fana, Kiristtoosa kahinunts hyalaqa maaqqize bonchchito faas ekkikaaya. Yezin Xoozii eza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">«Neenii ta Na7a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">Hyayno ta nees Ade maaqqida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 5:5">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>Mahi melle bessa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">«Malkkexaadiqe kahine shuuma maaqqidanni gaara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">neenii medhinas kahine maaqqada»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 5:6">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz. 110:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Yesuusa asi maaqqii hyanna alamite yeze wode fana hyayqoppa ashshodes dandda7ize Xoozza gaama yeeforan afutstsara woossida. E, Xooz bonchchii kiitinttide gisho Xoozii E woosito si7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Maato. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar. 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luqa. 22:39-46</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Yesuusa Xoozze Na7a maaqqikon ekkide madhite kiitintte tamaarida. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Yinnen, Yesuusa fa oochito folidannippa suuba faas kiitinttize ubba medhina atotitsi demmade fana oge maaqqida. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Yinnan Xoozii Malkkexaadiqe shuuma fana kahinunts hyalaqa mahi eza shuumida.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanora labbaame fana ingginttide naagize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Hyanna nu ohitilla afa gujjii ohodebaz gaama bazi yene, yezin yin qoftta eeratsi maaqqide gisho yinttis ohi geltsodes waayitsane. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Yin hyannii wode asttamaare maaqqades beezane, yezin Xoozze qaala tiino timirtte yinttana mahi tamaarssize melle asi koshshane. Yin mintsii katstsa maades dandda7oose gisho maatsi koshshane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:2">1 Qoro. 3:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Maatsi shichinttize ooden zhooga na7a maaqqide gisho lo77on iita shaakkii eroos. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Yezin mintsii katstsa koshshize lo77on iita shaakkize era yeze wozinaama asis.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Yikke, Kiristtoosa baz tamaarssize tiino timirttito ashshii Kiristtoosa gidda wozinaamunts timirttego yedhdhote. Hyayqo kaalitsize oochappa maaqqize bazin Xooz ammanebaz tiino timirttego suuba maaqqoos. <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>Yinnii fana, xinqqate baz,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Xinqqate baz: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hyanna besite xinqqate baz ga7inttidanna dumma dumma geeshe wogabaz ohodes. </char></note> kushe gaddebaz, hyayqoppa denddo bazin medhina firddabaz mahi tamaaroos. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Xoozii gayko nu yinno oochchoda.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Fettii tohe foo7o foo7iduntsana, salo imo ekkiduntsana, Geeshi Ayyaanappa gishinttiduntsana, <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>lo77o Xoozze qaalan tiinoppa ye7ode alamtti wolqqa bi7iduntsana, <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>suubappa kaddiduntsana nagarappa lam7intsa mahodes dandda7inttoos. Akkos gayko, un fa dhabes Xoozze Na7a mahi suxxize gaar masqalalla afa eza suxxanen as tiino kawushshane.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Ubba wode Eella afa bukkize ira uzhii, wootize atstsa maaddize katstsa inggize sa7ita Xoozara anjjinttidanno. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Yezin anggatsin kinchchikelo dolize sa7ita akko bazin maaddoos; iis baadditsi ukkida; wurssutsite michinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-18">Medho 3:17-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Nu siiqo ishuntso, nuunii hyannii gaar ohize baz maaqqikon, yinttana atotitsago kaalitsize lo77o baz yinttis yezanno erane. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Xoozii luule firddizaya. Xoozii, yin oochchide oochchiton zaga maaqqin hyatte ammanzuntsana maaddii, ees yeze siiqito beezidanno botoos. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Yin ubba ufayssara naagizanno denggode wontsis hyanna mintsitumtto folo yellodes beezode gaar nu amudhdhane. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Yin ammanoran dandda7ara naagize ufayssito laattize asi maaqqade gaar fattin azal7a maaqqade gaar koyoos.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozii inggide ufaysita so7izoos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Xoozii Abrahamas inggoda ga7i caaqqide wode faappa aadhize melle damma baayze gisho fa ommite caaqqida. <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>Eego, «Taanii nena anjjoda; ne zartto gantsoda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Medho 22:16-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Abrahama dandda7ara naagii Xoozii inggoda gayde ufaysito ekkida.<verse eid="HEB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Asi caaqqitera faappa dammize asara caaqqane; yinna caaqita ga7inttidebaz mintsii, lalle ubba hyaasane. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozii fa laaminttoose qofa ufays qaala laattizuntsis qonccissades koyde gisho caaqora mintsida. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Xoozii worddidhdhoos. E ufays qaalttan caaqita, lam77untsin laaminttoos. Hyanna lam77i bazite nu tiino yeze ufayssito aykkodes dandda7ode fana kate denggodes eego aachinttide nuunii, damma mintsitimo denggoda.<verse eid="HEB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Hyanna ufayssita nu shemppitis, markkabe en7inttaame fana mintsii aykkize meqo fana. Yinna ufaysita magaraajjafa suuba zalara yeze geeshi bessa gelida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Leewe 16:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>Yesuusa Malkkexaadiqe shuumatitsiti fana medhinas kahinunts hyalaqa maaqqii, nu gisho nuuppa tiinii yinna bessito gelida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz. 110:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Kahinze Malkkexaadiqe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Malkkexaadiqe, Saaleme Kaati, Ubbappa kattara Xoozze kahine. Ye Malkkexaadiqe Abrahama kaatuntsana olii gamii maaqqadera eera yellintti eza anjjida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Medho 14:17-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>Abrahama fa di7idebaz ubbappa ees asraata kessii inggida. Malkkexaadiqe suntsita tiino «Xillotits kaati», lam7intsa, «Saaleme kaati» bilitsita, «Sarotits kaati» ga7e. <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Malkkexaadiqes indda woy ade woy kochchi faydo baaya. E yeletitsitis denddo woy E yesttis folo baaya, yezin Xoozze Na7a aazize maaqqii medhinas kahine maaqqane.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Malkkexaadiqe akko gaar damma yezako bo7ote. Nu adunts mayze, Abrahama, fa di7idebazappa ees asraata inggida. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Kahine maaqqide Leewe kochchi Isra7eele asappa, yentsesin Abrahama kochchi maaqqide fa ishuntsappa asraata ekkode gaar higgita kiittane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Faydo 18:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Malkkexaadiqe Leewe kochchi maaqqanxikon Abrahameppa asraata ekkida; ufays qaala yeze Abrahama anjjida. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Geezay anggiseppa anjjinttizanna lallizoos.<verse eid="HEB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Fettii baggara, asraata ekkizuntsi hyayqize asuntsana, yezin melle baggara asraata ekkizuntsi de7o yene yaga7i ohinttida. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Yikke, asraata ekkize Leewe, Abrahama baggara asraata inggida gawudes dandda7inttane. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Akkos gayko, Malkkexaadiqe Abrahamera yelinttize wode Leewe yelinttikaayzebaz maaqqikon, fa mayze Abrahama bunqite yene.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Isra7eele asuntsis higge Leewe kahinetitsi baggara ingginttida. Hyanna Leewe kahinetitsita folo maaqqide baz yezako Aaronanni fana maaqqikaayzin, Malkkexaadiqe fana melle kahine shuumodes akkos koshshido? <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Yikke, kahinuntsi laaminttize wode higgitan mahi laaminttodes beezane. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Hyay nu E baz ohize atstse melle kochchi; E kochchitippa ooden zharsho bessa kahinetitsa oochchikaaya. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Nu Laatstse Yihuda kochchappa yi7idanna erinttizanno. Maaqqo yezin, Muse kahinuntsibaz ohitera Yihuda kochchi baz akkon ohikaaya.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Malkkexaadiqe fana melle kahinunts yi7idebaz maaqqizako hyanna nu ohizanna aadhii qonccoda. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>E kahine maaqqidanna dhaboose de7o wolqqite fattin E mayze higgiten wogite baaya. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Geeshi Maxaafize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">«Malkkexaadiqe kahinetitsi fana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:17">neenii medhinas kahinunts»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 7:17">yaga7i markkidhane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz. 110:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Tiino higgita labbide bazin maaddoose baz maaqqide gisho shaarinttida. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Muse higge akkoran folo oochchodes dandda7ikaaya. Yezin nuunii E baggara Xoozago shiiqize ubbappa aadhize ufays qaala nuus ingginttida.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Kiristtoosa kahine maaqqize wode Xoozii caaqqida, yezin melluntsi kahinunts maaqqize wode yinnii fana caaqo baaya. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Yezin Yesuusa caaqora kahine maaqqida. Xoozi ga7i caaqqida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">«Laatstsii caaqqida; E fa qoftto laammoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">‹Neenii medhina kahine› »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 7:21">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz. 110:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Hyanna caaqitii baggara Yesuusa nuus ubbappa aadhize qaala caaqitis waase maaqqida.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Kahinetitsi medhinas oochaame fana hyayqo unttana kayde gisho tiino kahinuntsi faydita gaama. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Yezin Yesuusa medhinas yeze gisho E kahinetitsito melle laattoos. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Yinnii gisho, E ubba wode un gisho woossodes medhina yeze gisho Xoozago E baggara ye7izuntsana folo ashshodes dandda7ane.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Yikke, nuus koshshize baz inggize, geeshi, boren tuna baayzuntsi, nagaranchchuntsappa shaakkinttidayin saloppa aadhii dhoqqa yeze kahinunts hyalaqa nuus koshshane. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>E hyankko kahinunts hyalaquntsi gaar tiino fa nagartti gisho kaallii as nagartti gisho qammite qammite zharsho zharshodes koshshoos. E fana zharshide wode lam7intsoosse ogera fettii tohe fana zharshida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Leewe 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Muse higgita labbitsi asi kahinunts hyalaqa mahi shuumane. Yezin higgefa suuba yi7ide caaqo qaaltta medhina folo maaqqide Xoozze Na7aya shuumida.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa nu kahinunts hyalaqa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Nuunii ohize damma bazita hyanno. Salo Ubbappa kattara Xoozze araatappa mizaqi zalar bettide hyay fana yeze kahinunts hyalaqa nuus yene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>E asara maaqqikaayzin Laatstsara eqqide turii dunkkaantte Xoozze Keetstsa oochchane.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Kahinunts hyalaqa ubbanna imon zharsho zharshodes shuumunttane. Yinnii gisho mahi, ye kahinze zharshodes fettibazi yessades koshshane. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Higge kiittizannifana zharshize kahinuntsi yeze gisho Kiristtoosa sa7a yeze baz maaqqizako kahine maaqqoos. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Un kahinetitsa oochchize dunkkaantta salo yezes aazizen dasho. Muse dunkkaane essize wode Xoozii eego, «Taanii nena derella afa beezide aazize kaallii oochcho» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Faydo 18:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Yezin Yesuusa igintsize gidda maaqqide caaqo, tiino caaqoppa aadhizannifana E ekkide oochita unttisitippa aadhane. Yinna eqqidanna aadhize caaqo qaalara.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Tiino caaqite bala baayze baz maaqqizako lam7intsa caaqo koshshoos. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Yezin Laatstsii unttana borii, hyannigaara yagayda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">«Taanii Isra7eele asuntsaran Yihuda asuntsara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">kille caaqo caaqqize wode ye7oda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Er. 31:31-34</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Yinna caaqita ta un aduntsana Gibxxe sa7appa kushito aykkii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">gochchi kesside wode unttara caaqqide caaqitii gaar baaya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">Un ta caaqite ammaninttikaayze gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">taanii unttana olii ashshida yagayda Laatstsii.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Yezin yikkeppa suuba Isra7eele asuntsara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">ta caaqqode caaqita hyanno yagayda Laatstsii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Taanii ta higgito un guugite gaddoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">un wozintte xaafoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Taanii un Xoozii maaqqada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">unttin ta asi maaqqada.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Unttappa ooden fa dootsiza woy fa isha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‹Laatstsi ero› yaga7i tamaarssoos.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Un eeratsappa damma yellodes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">ubbuntsi tana eroda.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Taanii un qohidanno atto gawuda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">un nagartto mahi qoppoos» yagayda.<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Xoozii hyay caaqiza «Kille» ga7i xeegittera tiinosaya gal7izida. Yikke, gal7izen cinggide dhabize wode yellida.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Salo goynon sa7a goyno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Tiino caaqitis Xooz goynize wogan sa7a Xoozze Keetstsi yene. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Dunkkaane eqqida. Ize xomppe gaddize bessi, xarphezan Laatstse tiino gaddize boora yene; yinna besita Geeshi Bessi ga7inttane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">Keze 26:1-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">25:31-40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Lam7intsa magaraajjafa suuba zalara yeze besita Ubbappa Geeshi Bessi ga7inttane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Keze 26:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>I gidda ixaane cugize worqqa saaxinen worqqara goozinttide caaqo Taabote yene. Ye caaqo Taabotize gidda manna yeze worqqa xaaro, aacide Aarona gufen Muse higge xaafinttide lam77i lochche shuchchuntsi yene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">Keze 30:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">25:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:33">16:33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:8-10">Faydo 17:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:16">Keze 25:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Mahe 10:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Ye Taabotizeppa katta zalara maarotits goozitsi fa qefite aachize bonchcho kiruubele yene. Yezin hyatte hyanna ubbanno qonccizi ohodes dandda7oos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Keze 25:18-22</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Hyanna ubbanna hyannigaara giigidannippa suuba, kahinuntsi ubba wode fa oochito oochchodes dunkkaanttis tiino kifilite gelane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Faydo 18:2-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Yezin kahinunts hyalaqa xalaala dunkkaanttis lam7intsa kifilite bereppa fettii tohe gelane. E yeyga gelittera fa nagartti gishon asuntsi erikaayzara oochchide nagartti gisho suutsi zharsho ekkikaayzara geloos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Leewe 16:2-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Tiino dunkkaane eqqii yezin, Ubbappa Geeshi Bessi kanggize ogita hyaga bugunttikaayzanno Geeshi Ayyaana yinne beezane.<verse eid="HEB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Yinna hyanna woditis aazize; Xoozzes ingginttize imottan zharshita goynize atstse wozintto geeshodes dandda7oosanno hyanna beezane. <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>Yentses muntta baz, ushshibaz dumma dumma meechchi wogito ohizuntsana. Un kille woga ye7ode wontsis oochinttize bale woga.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Yezin Kiristtoosa hyatte nu denggide lo77o bazis kahinunts hyalaqa maaqqii yi7ida. E gelide dunkkaantta damman folo. Yinna dunkkaantta as kushera oochinttikaaya mahi hyanna alamitibaz baaya. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Kiristtoosa Ubbappa Geeshi Bessi gelize wode deeshi suutsin duro suutsi ekkii gelikaaya. Yezin medhina atotitsi inggodes fa suutsito ekkii lam7intsoose ogera fettii tohe gelida. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Deeshi suutsin kormma suutsi, michinttide okka budo, tunide asuntsalla afa wuxurkkin unttana geeshizebaz maaqqiko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:15-16">Leewe 16:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 19:9">Faydo 19:9</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 19:17-19">17-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>medhina Geeshi Ayyaana baggara bore baayzin zharsho oochchii, Xoozis fana inggide Kiristtoosa suutsita, de7o Xooz goynode fana hyayqo kaalitsize oochappa nu wozintto wayzi aatsii geeshosa?<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Yinnii gisho, xeeginttiduntsi Xoozii inggide medhina laata ekkode gaar Kiristtoosa kille caaqos gidda maaqqii igintsizaya maaqqida. Yinna hyanidanna asuntsi tiino caaqoppa oomora yeze wode oochchide nagarappa unttana ashshodes E hyayqqida.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Yikke, keeke yeziko, ye keekide atstse hyayqita erinttodes koshshane. <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>Keekide atstse hyayqqiko E keekita minggane. Keekide atstse hyayqqanxi attiko E keekita oochchoos.<verse eid="HEB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Melle atto yezin, tiino caaqitan suutsi baayzin miinggikaaya. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Muse higge kiita ubba asis ohidannippa suuba duro suutsin deeshi suutsi hyaatsara worqqii, zoqo duro isintsen hisophe tashe ekkii, maxaafize galliton asunts gallito wuxurkkane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Keze 24:6-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>Muse asuntsago, «Yin naagode gaar Xoozii kiittide suuts caaqita hyanno» yagayda. <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Yinnii gaara, dunkkaanize galliton oochchize miishe ubbanni gallito suutsi wuxurkkane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Leewe 8:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Turon higgita gaazanni fana eeratsibaz fattin ubba bazi suutsara geezhane. Suutsi lanttikaayzin maarotitsi baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Leewe 17:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa folo zharshintte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Salo bazis aazize maaqqiduntsi ubba hyaars zharshora geeshshades koshshane. Yezin salo bazita fa ommite yinnippa aadhize zharshora geeshshades koshshane.<verse eid="HEB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Kiristtoosa turii Xoozze Keetstsis aazize maaqqide, as kushera oochinttide Ubbappa Geeshi Bessa gelikaaya. Yezin E hyatte nu gisho Xoozze tiino benttodes salo gelida. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Kahinunts hyalaqize berite berite fa suutsi maaqqikaayzanno ekkii, Ubbappa Geeshi Bessa gelane. Yezin Kiristtoosa gaama tohe fana zharshodes salo gelikaaya. <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Yinnii gaara hyanide baz maaqqizako, Kiristtoosa alame medhinttidannippa aykkii gaama tohe waayinttodes koshshane yeshsha. Yezin hyatte wode wurssutsite nagara hyaasodes fana zharshi lam7intsoosse ogera fettii tohe benttida.<verse eid="HEB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Asi ubba fettii tohe hyayqqodes yinnippa suuba firddinttodes beezane. <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>Yinnii fana, Kiristtoosa gaama asunts nagara hyaasodes fettii tohe zharshinttida. Yezin E nagara tookkodes maaqqikaayzin fana naagizuntsana ashshodes lam7intsa benttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa. 53:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Muse higge yo7odes yeze lo77o bazis dasho fattin fa ommite waanna baaya. Yinnii gisho, berite berite face baayzin zharshinttize zharshita goynodes shiiqize asuntsana folo mahodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Higge unttana folo mahodes dandda7idebaz maaqqizako un zharsho zharshizanno ashshoda yeshsha. Mahi goynodes shiiqize asuntsi fa nagarttippa geeshshada; un wozinttan unttana bala ga7i mootoos. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Yezin yinna zharshuntsi berite berite nagara qofizane. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Akkos gayko kormma suutsin deeshi suutsi nagara dhabisodes dandda7oos.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Yinnii gisho, Kiristtoosa hyanna alamite yi7ide wode hyannigaara yagayda:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Maz. 40:6-8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">«Neenii zharshon imo koykaaya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">yezin taas asho giigizida.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Neenii eexize zharshon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">nagara zharshite ufayttikaaya.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Ye wode ‹Ta gisho maxaafite xaafinttidannigaara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">Laatstso, taanii ne qoftto oochchodes yi7ida› gayda» yagaane.<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Zharshita zharshinttode gaar higge kiittizebaz maaqqizako, Kiristtoosa tiino, «Neenii zharshon imo, eexize zharshon nagara zharsho koykaaya; unttara ufayttikaaya» yagayda. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Kaallin E, «Laatstso, hyaychche taanii ne qoftto oochchodes yi7ida» yagayda. Yinnii gisho, Kiristtoosa lam7intsa essodes tiinosaya shaarida. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa Xoozze qofa oochchii, lam7intsoose ogera fettii tohe fa ashito zharshide gisho nuunii geezhida.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Kahinunts ubba, nagara hyaasodes dandda7oos yinna zharshito qammite qammite zharshitera eqqii fa oochito oochchane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Keze 29:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Yezin Kiristtoosa ubba wodes maaqqize fettii nagara zharsho zharshi, Xoozappa mizaqi zalara bettida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Ye wodeppa aykkii E morkkuntsi E tohita yedhdhize bessi mahode wontsis naagane. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>E lam7intsoose ogera fettii tohe fana zharshide zharshite geeshshuntsana medhinas folo oochchida.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Mahi Geeshi Ayyaana nuus hyanno markkidhane. Tiino hyannigaara yagayda:<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>«Yinna qammitippa suuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">taanii unttara caaqqize caaqita hyanno:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Laatstsii ta higgito un wozintte gaddoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">un guugite xaafoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 10:16">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Er. 31:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Kaallii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">«Taanii un nagartton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">un iita oochito mahi qoppoos»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 10:17">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Er. 31:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Yikke, nagara atto ga7inttidannippa suuba nagaras zharshinttize zharsho koshshoos.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ane Xoozago shiiqoda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Yikke, ta ishuntso, nuunii Yesuusa suutsiti baggara Ubbappa Geeshi Bessi gelodes nuus ammantsize yene. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Nu gelodanna Kiristtoosa fa magaraajjito, yinnan fa ashtii baggara nuus bugide killen de7o maaqqide oge. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Nuus Xoozze Keetstsa kattara shuumunttide damma kahinunts hyalaqa yene. <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>Yinnii gisho Nuunii iita qofappa geeshshades nu wozintto wuxurkkintti, nu gallito xillo hyaatsara meeccii, luule wozinaran folo ammanora Xoozago shiiqoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Leewe 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Hiz. 36:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Nuus ufays qaala inggide Xoozze ammaninttidaya maaqqide gisho nu markkidhize ufaysito mizaqi workkita gaykaayzara mintsii aykkoda. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Fetay feta siiqosin lo77o oochas wayzi dentsitsod yezako ane qoppoda. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Fete fete limdde mahi shiiqizanno ashshidanni fana nuunii wolla shiiqizanno ashshoos. Yezin Laatstse qammita ukkidanno yin be7ize gisho yinno zagannippa aatsii oochchote.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Nuunii turii eratitsi ekkidannippa suuba eriite nagara oochchoos, yikkeppa nu nagara gisho zharshinttode zharsho baaya. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>Yezin yikke attidanna zhashize firddan Xoozze morkkuntsana michchodes giigide damma tama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa. 26:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Muse higgito kiitinttanxide ooden lam77i woy hyaydzdzii asi eella afa markkidhiko yiqsimo baytsi hyayqqane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Mahe 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Yeezin, Xoozze Na7aya toochiday, fana geeshide Xoozze caaqo suutsito tunizide, mahi aadho keehatitsi Ayyaana cazhiday, akko gaar iita firdda ekkodes beezizako ane qoppote.<verse eid="HEB 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Yikke, «Kushe mahe ta baz, ta kushe mahoda» gaydanno nu erane. Mahin, «Laatstsii fa asuntsana firddoda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Mahe 32:35</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 32:36">36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>De7o Xoozze kushite gol7e gaama zhashane.<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Yinttis Xoozze foo7o foo7idannippa suuba yin gaama waayera, damma olara genccide zaga wodito qoppote. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Fettii fettii tohe yin as tiino cazhinttida; bay7inttida; fettii fettii tohe yinnii fana waaye yellide asuntsara wolla waayinttida. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Achcha yeze asuntsisin yiqsinttida. Yinttis lo77on dhaboose qolo salo yezanno yin eride gisho yin qoltta bonqinttize wode ufayssara dandda7ida.<verse eid="HEB 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Yinnii gisho, damma anjjo yeze yin ammaninttidaya olippete. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Xoozze qofa folii, E yinttis inggoda gayde ufayssito ekkode wontsis genccodes koshshane. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Yikke, Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">«E, ye7oda gayday eeratsi wodeppa suuba ye7oda; gam7oos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37-38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:3-4">Ibr. 2:3-4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Yezin xillize, ammanora yessada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">ooden suub maaqqiko tana ufayssoos»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 10:38">yagayda. <verse eid="HEB 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Nuunii ammanii attize asunts bagga fattin suuba maaqqii dhabize asunts bagga baaya.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Ammano gaazanna, denggoda ga7i ufayssara ammaninttii naagize bazin nu bi7ikaayze baz bi7ide fana mahi ekkizebaz. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Zaga aduntsi ammanora Xoozappa markkatitsi ekkida.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>Alame Xoozze qaalara medhinttidanno nu ammanora erane. Mahi benttize baz benttoosse bazappa medhinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:1">Medho 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Maz. 33:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 33:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:3">Waha. 1:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Aabeela Qaa7elaseppa aadhize zharsho Xoozis zharshidanna ammanora. Xoozii Aabeela imot ufaytti ekkide wode E xillo maaqqidanno markkidhida. Aabeela melle atto yezin, hyayqqin E ammantta hyayno yellodes ohinttane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Medho 4:3-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Heenoka hyayqqikaayzara salo ekinttidanna ammanora. Xoozii eza ekkide gisho ooden eza be7ades dandda7ikaaya. Heenoka salo ekinttodannippa tiino E Xoozze ufaysside asi maaqqizanna ohinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Medho 5:21-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Ammano baayzin ooden Xooz ufayssodes dandda7oos. Xoozago ye7ize ooden Xoozii yezannon fana koyezuntsis anjjo inggizanno ammanodes koshshane.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Nohe hyaga benttoosse bazis Xoozii ees ohide wode Xoozis zhashtii, fanan fa kara asuntsana ashshodes ammanora markkabe keexxida. Yeyzi fa ammanttira alamito firddi, ammanora benttize xillotitsi Xoozappa ekkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Medho 6:13-22</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Abrahama laata mahi ekkode sa7a qitode gaar Xoozii eza xeegide wode melle atto yezin, E aba qitizako eranxikon kiitinttidanna ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Medho 12:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Abrahama Xoozii ees inggoda gayde sa7ite bete asi fana yezidanna ammanora. Xoozii ye inggoda gaydanno eera wolla laattodes yeze Yisaaqaran Yayqoobara dumma dumma dunkkaane gidda yezida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Medho 35:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>E, Xoozii qoppii keexxide xaala baasa yeze katama naagane.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Saara fa ommite cinggidanno maaqqikon ufayssi inggide Xoozze ammaninttidaya maaqqidanno eride gisho wodaxodes wolqqa dengidanna ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Medho 18:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Yinnii gisho, hyayqqide asi aazize fettii dhiiratseppa salo xoolintto gaaran abba gaxa yeze faydo baayze shafe fana kochchi yelinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Medho 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:12">32:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Yentsi asuntsi ubba faas ga7inttide ufays qaala ekkikaayzara ammanora hyayqqida. Yezin hyaakora yinno bi7i, denggide fana mahi, ufayssara ekkida. Mahi un sa7alla zaqqon bete asi maaqqizanno erida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:4">Medho 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1 Zeena 29:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Maz. 39:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Yinnii fana gaaze asuntsi fa sa7ito naagizanno qoncce beezane. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Un ashshii kezide sa7ito suuba qoppidebaz maaqqizako suuba maaqqades dandda7ane. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Yezin hyatte aadhize salo gade amudhdhane. Yinnii gisho, Xoozii unttis katama giigizide gisho «Un Xooz» ga7intti xeeginttodes yeellidhoos.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Abrahama fattaninttide wode Yisaaqa zharshidanna ammanora. Yinna ufays qaaltto ekkide Abrahama fa fettii na7a zharshodes giigida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Medho 22:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>Xoozii Abrahamago, «Ne zartta Yisaaqa baggara xeeginttoda» yaga7i ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medho 21:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Xoozii hyayqoppa dentsodes dandda7izanno Abrahama ammanide gisho Yisaaqa hyayqoppa faxii denddide fana mahi ekkida.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Yisaaqa wodeppa hyanodebaz erii Yayqooban Eesawo anjjidanna ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Medho 27:27-29</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 27:39-40">39-40</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Yayqooba hyayqqodes yiiter, feta feta Yoosefa na7untsana anjjidannan guufella katii goynidanna ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:3">Medho 47:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 48:1-20">48:1-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Yoosefa hyayqqodes ukkide wode Isra7eele asuntsi Gibxxeppa kezodanno ohidanna fa meqatsito yiissadebaz unttana kiittidanna ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:24-25">Medho 50:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Keze 13:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>Muse yelinttidannippa suuba E inttan E aday bishshita lo77o na7a maaqqidanno bi7i hyaydzdzii agina aachchidanna ammanora; un kaat awaajjes zhashtikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:22">Keze 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 2:2">2:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Muse diccidannippa suuba Gibxxe kaat urtti na7a ga7inttodanno ixxidanna ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:10-12">Keze 2:10-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Muse nagarara eerats wodes ufayttodannippa, Xoozze asara madha ekkodanno doorida. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>E tiinoppa denggode anjjito phircci yiizii bi7ide gisho Gibxxe qoloppa aatsii Kiristtoosa gisho borinttodanno gaama aadhize duretitsi maaqqidanno erida.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Muse Kaat kachchi zhashtikaayzara, Gibxxeppa kezidanna ammanora. Benttoosse Xoozza bi7ide asfana yii7i fa qoftte genccida. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Hyayqo ki7ize kiitanchchuntsi Isra7eele asunts angis na7untsana wodhaame gaar Muse Faasikan suutsi wuxurike woga oochchidanna ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Keze 12:21-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Isra7eele asuntsi mela sa7ara yedhdhize fana yedhdhii, Zoqo Abba fiinggidanna ammanora. Yezin Gibxxe asuntsi gelodes fattanii be7adera haatsita unttana qoodhdhida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Keze 14:21-31</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Isra7eele asuntsi Iyaarkko katama shuchchi gase laappun wode wutii, gol7izidanna ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:12-21">Iya. 6:12-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Olalera erinttidanna Re7aaba gade geedizuntsana mokkide gisho kiitinttoose asuntsara hyayqqanxi attidanna ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Iya. 2:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 6:22-25">6:22-25</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Yikke, melle ta akko ga7o? Gediyoona baz, Baaraqebaz, Samsoonabaz, Yofttaahebaz, Dawutebaz, Saamu7eela baz, mahi nabuntsbaz ohodes taas wode maaqqoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:11-8:32">Danu. 6:11—8:32</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6-5:31">4:6—5:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:2-16">13:2-16</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:1-12">11:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1">1 Sam. 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:11">1 Kat. 2:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>Un ammanora ka7itumtto gamida; xillotitsara ahida; Xoozii inggoda gayde ufayssito ekkida; gaammuntsi doona gorddida;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:1-27">Dane. 6:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>tama wolqqa wodhida; morkkunts mashshappa attida; fa labbisite minggida; olara wolqqaama maaqqida; allaga tooranchuntsana bay7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:1-30">Dane. 3:1-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Maachuntsi un iginuntsi hyayqqiduntsi hyayqoppa faxin ekkida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Mahi melluntsi aadhize hyayqoppa denddo ekkodes koyi dumma dumma waaye ekkida; achchappa bilinttodanno ixxida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:17-24">1 Kat. 17:17-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:25-37">2 Kat. 4:25-37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Melluntsi asara borinttii allanggara garafinttida; melluntsi santsalaatara acinttii achi keetstsa olinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:26-27">1 Kat. 22:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25-26">2 Zeena 18:25-26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Er. 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15">37:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Un shuchchara dhoginttida; magaazera lam77i kezii phalqqinttida; fattaninttida; mashshara hyayqqida; unttis ubba bazi dhabin madhidhida. Duro mo7on deeshi mo7o ma77i hyanttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2 Zeena 24:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Unttis hyanna alamtta giiganxi ixxin akko baayze sa7an, derella afa, wom7on olla giddan wutida.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Xoozii un ammanttibaz markkidhikon, yinna ubba ga7inttide ufays qaaltto ekkikaaya. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Xoozii nuus lo77o baz qoppida; yinnii gisho un nu baytsi folo maaqqoos.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoozii nuus ade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Yikke, dhonne fana nu kantto wutii gaanggi hyannii fana markkuntsi nu kale yeze gisho nuna dhubbize ubbannon aykkinttii yeze nagara hyaasii, nu tiino yeze galgaade wotsito gencci woxxoda. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Nu ammanttis oge bugidayan nuna folo yeltsize Yesuusalla afa nu aafito gaddoda. Yesuusa tiinoppa yeze ufayssiti gisho masqalalla waaye dandda7i, yeella hyayqo leqqii, Xoozappa mizaqi zalara bettida.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Yikke, yin doccii ufayssi gachchaame fana nagaranchchunts ixa dandda7ide Yesuusa qoppote. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Nagarara yeze bute hyaga suuts lalode wontsis eqinttikaaya. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Xoozii fa qaaltte, fa na7unts fana yinttana zoridanno botida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:17">Iyo. 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:11-12">Aazi. 3:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">«Ta na7ayo, Xoozze seere leqqippe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">E nena seerize wode ufayssi gachchippe.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Laatstsii fa kadhize atstsa seerane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">mahi fa na7a fana ekkiza ubba garaafane»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 12:6">yagayda. <verse eid="HEB 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Xoozii yinttana fa na7unts fana seerize wode genccote; Aday seeroosse na7ay oode? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Xoozii fa na7untsana ubba seerane; yin seerinttanxiko turii E na7a baayzin balako na7a. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Mahi nuna yelide nu aduntsi nuna seerane; nuunin unttana bonchchane. Yeezin, nuunii de7o yessades nu ayyaana Ades wayzi aadhii aqoso? <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Yikke, nu aduntsi faas lo77o yessade fana eerats wodes nuna seerida. Yezin Xoozii nu maades, nu E geeshshatitsito gishinttode fana seerane. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Nu seerinttize wode zhilizane fattin ufayssoos. Yezin suubappa seeretsito lammadinttide asis seeritsita, saro kumide xillotitsi aafe aafizane.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zoren naagizen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Yikke, yin arggacide kushiton yin labbide bunqqito mintsote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:3">Isa. 35:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Wobbide faxode gaar fattin aadhii meqqaame gaar yin tohitis luule oge giigizote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Aazi. 4:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Asi ubbara saro yessadesin geeshshatitsara yessades minggote; geeshshatitsi baayzin ooden Laatstsii be7ades dandda7oos. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Yinttappa oodesin Xoozze aadho keehatitsita faccaame fana, mahi camo aafe aafize xapho dolii gaama asi tunizen dhabsize budutsi fana maaqqaame gaar naaginttote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Mahe 29:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Yin gidda olalize asi woy fettii tohe muuze katstsas fa anggistimo leqqii bayzide Eesawo fana asi yezaame gaar naaginttote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Medho 25:29-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Suubappa Eesawo yinna anjjito ekkodes koyze wode kaydanno erane. E yinna anjjito afutstsara miinggi koykon, denggodes dandda7ikaaya; E nagarappa maaqqades ixa denggikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Medho 27:30-40</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Yin kushite bochinttize Siina derego, eexize tamago, dhumago, qayqayogon, gotego,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">Keze 19:16-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">20:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:11-12">Mahe 4:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:22-27">5:22-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>moyze oolle woy qaala sinttize bessago yi7ikaaya. Yinna qaaltto si7ide asuntsi melle guja qaala si7aame fana woossida. <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>Akkos gayko, «Melle atto yezin, xootsii ye deriza bochchiko, shuchchara dhoginttii hyayqo» yaga7i kiita un tookkodes dandda7ikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Keze 19:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Yinna hyanize bazita gaama dagantsize baz maaqqide gisho Muse, «Taanii zhashimora goqida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Mahe 9:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Yezin yin Xiyoone Derizego, de7o Xoozii yeze Yerusalaame katama, fettilla shiiqii ufayttize gaama mukul kiitanchchuntsago salo yi7ida. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Un suntsita salo xaafinttide woosa keetstsis anggis na7untsago, as ubba firddize Xoozago, folo maaqqide xillo asunts ayyaanago yi7ida. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Kille caaqitis gidda maaqqii igintsize Yesuusago, Aabeela suutsappa aadhizebaz ohize wuxurkkinttide suutsago yi7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Medho 4:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Yinttis ohize atstse qaaltto si7oos ga7aame gaar naaginttote. Zaguntsi sa7appa ohide kiitto si7anxi ixxii attikaayzebaz maaqqiko yeezin, saloppa ohize qaaltto nuunii koyoos gayko wayzi attode?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:22">Keze 20:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Ye wode E qaaltta sa7a en7izida. Yezin hyatte taanii, «Sa7a xalaala maaqqikaayzin fettii tohe mahi salo en7isada» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag. 2:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>«Fettii tohe mahi» gaaze qaaltta en7inttoosebaz miinggi yessade gaar en7inttize medhinttide bazita dhabodanno beezane.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Nuunii en7odes dandda7oosse ka7itumo ekkize gisho Xoozza galatane; Xoozza ufayssize ogera bonchchoran zhashimoran eza goynoda. <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>Yikke, nu Xoozze turippa michchize tama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Mahe 4:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Ammanze asi fana fetay fetera folo siiqinttote. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Zaqqo mokkizanno botifete. Fettii fettii asuntsi yinnii gaara oochitera erikaayzara kiitanchchuntsana mokkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Medho 18:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Achcha yezuntsana yinttin unttara wolla achcha yezefana mahi unttana qoppote. Madha ekkize asuntsara wolla yinttin madha ekkizefana mahi unttana qoppote.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Machcho ekken gelen as ubba kale bonchchinttidebaz maaqqe. Mahi Xoozii olale hyanttizuntsanan laammizuntsana firddodes yeze gisho azinzen machchita fetay fetes ammaninttodes beezane.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Bira siiqoppa yinttana naagote; yinttis yezanna maaqqada. Xoozii, «Taanii nena muloran oloosi woy ashshoosi» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Mahe 31:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Iya. 1:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Yinnii gisho, nuunii ammaninttii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">«Laatstsii tana maaddizaya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">zhashtoos; asi tana akko yissade?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 13:6">gawuda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Maz. 118:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Xoozze qaala tiino yinttis ohide yinttana kaalitsizuntsana qoppote. Un wayzi yezezako un yestto bi7i un ammantto kaallote.<verse eid="HEB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa omatsen hyaynon medhinas laaminttoos. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Dumma dumma kille timirttera melle bessa qitii dhabippete; qitippete. Nu wozuntta Xoozze aadho keehatitsite minggodes beezane fattin mu7in maaddoose katstsaran woga folera maaqqippe.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Nuus zharsho bessi yene. Yezin dunkkaane gidda oochchize kahinuntsi yinna zharsho katsitifa ma7ades unttis adetits wolqqa baaya. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Kahinunts hyalaqize nagara zharshos hyaars suutsi ekkii zharshodes Ubbappa Geeshi Bessa gelane. Yezin ye hyaarsize ashito gaseppa bale michchane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Leewe 16:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Yinnii fana, Yesuusa asuntsana nagarappa fa suutsite geeshshodes katama furtsafa balera waayinttida. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Yikke, nuunii E bortto tookkii gaseppa bale eego yedhdhote. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Yikke, nuus hyanne medhinas yeze katama baaya, yezin nuunii ye7ode katamito naagane.<verse eid="HEB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Yikke, Yesuusa baggara ubba wode E suntsitis markkidhize doona galata zharsho Xoozis inggoda. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Lo77o baz oochchen yinttis yeze bazappa melle asis ingge botifete. Yikke, yinnii fana yeze zharsho Xooz ufayssane.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Yinttana kaalitsizuntsis kiitinttote; un gaazebaz oochchote. Un fa oochchize bazitis Xoozze tiino oocinttodes yeze gisho yinttana yenggane. Yin unttis kiitinttiko, fa oochito ufaytti oochchoda; yinna hyananxiko, un azzanora oochchoda; yinna yinttana akko bazin maaddoos.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Nuus Xooz woossote. Nu wozintta geeshi; nu ubba wode lo77o baz oochchodes koyane. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Taanii yinttago ellisii ye7ode fana yin taas mintsii Xooz woossode fana ta yinttana hyadara gaane.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Sarotits Xoozze, duro yenggize nu Laatstse Yesuusa, fa medhina caaqo suutsite hyayqoppa dentsiday, <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>E qoftto oochchode fana lo77o baz ubbanne E yinttana danccizo. Eza ufayssize baz Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara nu gidda Xoozii oochcho. Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara Xoozis medhinappa medhina yellodes bonchcho maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Ta ishuntso, ta hyay xaafide kiitiza yinttis hyaatara xaafide gisho yin ta zortto azal7ikaayzara ekkode fana ta yinttana woossane.<verse eid="HEB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Nu ishe, Ximotiyoosa achchappa bilinttidanno erote. E ellisii taago yi7iko ta eera yinttana hyanggi be7ada.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Yinttana kaalitsizuntsanan ammanzuntsana ubba saro ga7ote. Xaaleppa yi7ide ammanze asuntsi yinttana saro yagaane.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Xoozze aadho keehatitsita yin ubbuntsara maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
